"policy.commons":"Commons","policy.commons.left":"Privatization","policy.commons.right":"Shared goods","policy.commons.tradeoff":"More cohesion, less rent","event.drought.title":"The riverbed emerges","event.drought.body":"Pools along the trail are shrinking. Water carriers must walk farther each day.","event.dryHarvest.title":"Berries dry on the riverbank","event.dryHarvest.body":"Bushes near the water bear little fruit. Stored roots are the camp’s last reserve.","event.winter.title":"A long cold season","event.winter.body":"Snow has covered the trails. The outlying hearths have food for two nights.","event.grazing.title":"Worn pastures","event.grazing.body":"The herds reach the fields before their herders.","event.storeroom.title":"Granaries past capacity","event.storeroom.body":"Sacks left outside attract animals. The council asks for a shared reserve.","event.flood.title":"The river changes course","event.flood.body":"A flood has moved the riverbed closer to the fields.","event.silt.title":"Silted canals","event.silt.body":"Water flows where the records say it should not.","event.shortage.title":"The price of bread","event.shortage.body":"The ovens in the poorest districts will open empty. Merchants have grain, but the harvest meant to repay their loans is still in the fields.","event.soil.title":"Exhausted soil","event.soil.body":"Output is rising. Fertility is moving the other way.","event.heat.title":"An unrelenting summer","event.heat.body":"Demand for water outstrips reserves in several regions.","event.split.title":"Two fires at camp","event.split.body":"A group has left the communal fire. It wants a say.","event.feud.title":"A feud between clans","event.feud.body":"An old dispute returns as supplies run short.","event.inherit.title":"The elders’ place","event.inherit.body":"The assembly must choose who will keep the group’s memory.","event.common.title":"The granary boundary","event.common.body":"One door separates those with a harvest from those who must ask.","event.ledger.title":"The debt is written","event.ledger.body":"For the first time even an old debt has a good memory.","event.quarrel.title":"The assembly divides","event.quarrel.body":"Two squares demand to speak for the same city.","event.creed.title":"Conflicting calendars","event.creed.body":"Villages argue over shared festivals, debts and market days.","event.pamphlets.title":"Pamphlets in the squares","event.pamphlets.body":"A printed sheet travels through the markets before dawn.","event.strike.title":"The workshops fall silent","event.strike.body":"Workers ask for time and income in a city used to machine schedules.","event.polarization.title":"Two versions of the world","event.polarization.body":"Each community hears only the news that confirms its fears.","event.injury.title":"Return from the hunt","event.injury.body":"The injured return before the hunt. Families ask for help.","event.crowding.title":"Houses too close","event.crowding.body":"The village grew quickly. Its drains did not.","event.fever.title":"Fever in the village","event.fever.body":"Homes close one by one. Care takes resources.","event.wells.title":"Clouded wells","event.wells.body":"The village wonders whether to drink the remaining water.","event.animals.title":"Pens and houses","event.animals.body":"The most convenient enclosure is closest to the sleeping quarters.","event.roadSickness.title":"Illness along the roads","event.roadSickness.body":"Towns along the road ask for coordinated care.","event.cityAir.title":"Factory air","event.cityAir.body":"The factories work at night. So do the doctors.","event.wards.title":"Full wards","event.wards.body":"The health network has grown more slowly than the population.","event.burnout.title":"Always switched on","event.burnout.body":"The council hears from citizens who struggle to sleep and meet one another.","event.orbitCare.title":"Care at a distance","event.orbitCare.body":"The first health convoy lags behind the new habitats.","event.exchange.title":"Goods on the trail","event.exchange.body":"Neighbouring villages propose exchanging their surplus.","event.weights.title":"The right weight","event.weights.body":"Every stall uses a different measure, even when it has the same name.","event.clerks.title":"The paperwork piles up","event.clerks.body":"Two offices record the same harvest. Neither records the waiting.","event.borderTax.title":"Tolls on the bridge","event.borderTax.body":"The bridge joins the banks. The toll divides them again.","event.credit.title":"Promises on credit","event.credit.body":"Merchants want guarantees on routes that have grown too long.","event.lobby.title":"A factory audience","event.lobby.body":"A consortium offers public works in exchange for favourable terms.","event.subsidies.title":"Subsidies before the assembly","event.subsidies.body":"A new safety net forces the council to choose whom to fund first.","event.servers.title":"Who owns the network","event.servers.body":"Shared knowledge depends on a handful of private nodes.","event.automationGap.title":"Production without wages","event.automationGap.body":"The machines produce enough. Incomes follow another rhythm.","event.newHarbor.title":"Passage to a new harbour","event.newHarbor.body":"The first orbital communities want autonomy and a mutual support compact.","tier.empire":"Empire","tier.industrial":"Industrial nation","tier.global":"Global civilization","app.campaign":"Campaign","slot.title":"Your civilizations","slot.new":"New civilization","slot.resume":"Continue","slot.import":"Import save","slot.export":"Export save","slot.empty":"Empty slot","slot.label":"Game {n}","slot.back":"Back to saved games","slot.saved":"Local save","slot.error":"Local saves could not be accessed.","slot.invalid":"This file is not a valid Epoche save.","slot.conflict":"This game is open in another tab.","slot.overwrite":"Replace the save in this slot?","slot.restart":"Start a new civilization in this slot?","genesis.title":"Genesis",